    "title": "Hartselle man gets suspended sentence for filming child in Walmart bathroom stall - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago DECATUR, Ala. — A Hartselle man charged with recording a child in a Walmart bathroom stall has been sentenced after pleading guilty in Morgan County Circuit Court. Blake Thomas Lorance, who was 19 at the time of the 2023 incident, appeared before Judge Charles B. Elliott on Monday and entered a guilty plea to Aggravated Criminal Surveillance. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
